10 REM KALEIDOSCOPE - THE PICTURE IS DRAWN BY A 6502 ROUTINE
20 REM THE BLOCK LOADS AT 768, IN THE FREE RAM BELOW LOMEM. ITS FIRST
30 REM THREE BYTES ARE THE PARAMETERS AND CALL 771 IS THE ENTRY POINT.
40 REM SEE SAMPLES/KALEIDO.ASM FOR THE SOURCE.
50 REM ONE INPUT FOR ALL THREE: EVERY LINE PRINTED BEFORE THE PICTURE
60 REM IS A LINE OF IT THE SCROLL WILL CARRY OFF THE TOP.
70 INPUT "SEED,TWIST,PASSES",S,T,N
80 IF N<1 THEN N=1
90 IF N>4 THEN N=4
100 POKE 768,ABS(S) MOD 256
110 POKE 769,ABS(T) MOD 256
120 POKE 770,N
130 CALL 771
140 END
